  derives from Trinculo54/fh2-mod-platform (MIT, licenses/FH2-hooks-MIT.txt); it bundles its own
  MinHook (BSD notices, licenses/Mod-MinHook-LICENSE.txt) and SQLite (public domain,
  licenses/SQLite-VERSION.txt); its two C SDK headers are MIT (licenses/Mod-SDK-LICENSE.txt).
